plugin/Background.qml is a generated review snapshot derived from Omarchy's background renderer.
The source file's SHA-256 is recorded in its header and patch/marketplace-snapshot.json.
Omarchy is Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson, MIT licensed; the full notice is retained in
licenses/OMARCHY-MIT.txt and is also copied into installer-generated plugin folders.
Source: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy

The end-user installer derives Background.qml from the Omarchy installed on that machine.
Nothing in /usr/share/omarchy is modified. The installed plugin records its source SHA-256.

PortraitMapping.qml and PortraitRuntime.js originated in Bogen (https://github.com/marselnenaj/bogen),
MIT licensed, by Marsel Nenaj and contributors. Compatibility identifiers are retained.

assets/readme/hero.png and preview.png are original AI-generated project illustrations,
made with OpenAI's image generation tool. They illustrate separately composed theme artwork;
they are not screenshots or artwork generated by the plugin. The generation prompt is retained
in assets/readme/image-prompt.txt. These project assets are distributed under the project license.

tests/fixtures/background-stock-anchors.qml is a synthetic test fixture, not Omarchy's full file.
